From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:02:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] tboir: add Archipelago Gifting support (gifting option,
 client giftbox)

Adds the gifting option (on by default). The Isaac client opens a v3 giftbox,
forwards received gifts to the game, removes them once the game confirms,
and sends gifts built by the game (AP Character Lock's Gift Box) to players
whose giftbox accepts them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
